{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-01-08 14:00:00', 'title': 'PHOTO RELEASE — HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES ANNOUNCES NEW VICE PRESIDENT, BUSINESS MANAGEMENT, AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AT INGALLS SHIPBUILDING', 'text': 'PASCAGOULA, MISS., JAN. 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT KEITH MUNN HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO VICE PRESIDENT, BUSINESS MANAGEMENT, AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER FOR INGALLS SHIPBUILDING. IN HIS NEW ROLE, HE WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR ALL FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT, CONTRACT MANAGEMENT AND BUSINESS MANAGEMENT FUNCTIONS AT INGALLS.'}